Register an application at <a href="https://www.deviantart.com/developers/register">https://www.deviantart.com/developers/register</a>.
<br>The redirect URI must be set to <code>https://localhost</code>. Publish the App after creation.
<br>
<br>If you had previously created an app, you must migrate it to OAuth 2.1. The app will be listed on <a href="https://www.deviantart.com/studio/apps">https://www.deviantart.com/studio/apps</a>. Also change the redirect to start with <code>https://</code>.
